  "criteria_declared_before_measurement_CORRECTION": "HONESTY CORRECTION, raised by review and accepted. The key name above says 'declared before measurement'. That is NOT what happened and the claim is withdrawn. The actual sequence: the screening loop computed and PRINTED the full per-subject table for all 22 candidates (centreline length, maximum inscribed diameter, gap to stomach, trachea-top offset, component count) FIRST; the S1-S6 thresholds were written in the NEXT cell, with that table already on screen. The QUANTITIES to measure were chosen in advance, but the THRESHOLD VALUES were set with the distribution visible. Two consequences follow and both are reported: (a) S1-S6 must be read as post-hoc thresholds over pre-chosen quantities, not as a pre-registered screen; (b) the separately-flagged round-2 criteria S7/S8 are post hoc in the stronger sense that the QUANTITIES themselves (neighbour aortic volume, tortuosity) were not considered until the round-1 winner turned out to have an ectatic aorta.",
  "criteria_declared_before_measurement_RENAMED": "criteria_thresholds_set_with_table_visible"
 },
